    "note": "Signed act 06/22/2021. Large file read by grep and sections. Section 1 amends 13-14-105.5 and the text mixes struck and kept words; lower-case words in Section 1 may be struck, check the page image. Quoted lower-case lines in 13-14-105.5(2) sit next to capitals and may carry struck words in their sentence; prefer the capital words. Sections 2-4 make matching changes to 18-1-1001 and 18-6-801 (not quoted)."
